[00:00.000]作词 : Donna Kim | [by:LUXURI2001]
[00:01.000]作曲 : Harvey Goldfinch/Skye Ramsay
[00:18.367]Dear machine, I am haunted | 冰冷机器，我仍被
[00:21.575]By a world that swallows me | 吞噬我的世界日夜困扰
[00:24.564]The ice beneath me, frozen memories | 我身下的寒冰，封存的记忆
[00:27.877]Slowly breaking as I reach | 当我正欲触碰，却缓缓破碎
[00:30.922]So can I climb, through snow and ice | 所以我可否勇攀这座冰峰？
[00:34.333]Taking strides through this new life | 迈步前进，开辟全新的人生
[00:37.356]Or drift astray, as I decay | 还是会飘摇不定，渐渐腐朽
[00:40.579]The mountain claims me as its own | 群山把我称作它的囊中之物
[00:44.772]I just wanna crumble to the ground (Please tell me how) | 我只想破碎，散落一地 (请告诉我如何)
[00:51.214]All alone, can someone hold me now? (If I knew now) | 孑然一身，此刻可否有人拥我入怀？ (此刻若我知晓)
[00:57.140]The winds, they're calling out to me | 凌冽寒风，正召唤着我
[01:02.175]And I can barely breathe | 而我几近窒息
[01:04.762]Dear machine, can I break free | 冰冷机器，我可否挣脱
[01:08.348]From these thoughts that beckon me | 那些紧紧纠缠我的思绪
[02:14.305]Fear, has fallen down on me | 恐惧悄然落于我身
[02:18.930]I'm buried in too deep | 我已被埋太深
[02:22.127]I stumble to my feet | 跌跌撞撞
[02:24.709]Tears frozen to my cheek | 眼泪凝结在我脸颊
[02:28.721]Dreams that bring me light | 赐予我光芒的梦想
[02:31.179]They tell me to survive | 告诫我努力活下去
[02:34.727]I'm reaching | 我正在向
[02:38.099]A life beyond the, fear | 外面的人生进发，恐惧
[02:41.274]Can take its toll on me | 能够让我受尽折磨
[02:44.526]If fear is all I see | 若我只能看见恐惧
[02:47.721]Come chase me as I seek | 就跟随我的脚步，将我追逐
[02:50.937]A new reality | 我正寻觅全新现实
[02:54.127]I watch the northern lights | 我见证着耀眼极光
[02:57.282]They gleam against the night | 无惧黑夜
[03:00.558]I choose to stay alive | 而我选择保持鲜活
[03:03.724]I'm reaching for | 我正追寻
[03:14.931]I'm reaching for | 我正追寻
[03:16.590]A life beyond the peak | 高峰之外一段崭新人生